[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0568","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0568.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0806","title":"Sun Solaris dtprintinfo 程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 操作系统中的 dtprintinfo 打印信息管理程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序通常以 setuid root 权限运行，本地攻击者可通过向程序传入超长参数或环境变量触发栈缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，从而将本地普通用户权限提升至 root 权限，完全控制受影响系统。攻击条件为攻击者已获得本地账户访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0806"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-05-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-05-10T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 官方针对 dtprintinfo 缓冲区溢出发布的安全补丁；在补丁未部署前，可移除 dtprintinfo 程序的 setuid 位以降低本地提权风险，并严格限制本地用户账户的分配。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0806"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0568.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0568.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0568.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1189","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1189.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1566","title":"iParty Conferencing Server 远程缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"iParty Conferencing Server 1.2 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过连接默认 6004 端口并发送大量扩展字符，触发缓冲区溢出导致服务器崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 iParty Conferencing Server 所有低于 1.2 的版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1566"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-05-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:43Z","remediation":"iParty Conferencing Server 1.2 及更早版本已不受支持，建议升级至官方修复后的最新版本（如有）。如厂商已停止维护，应在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 端口 6004 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，或将该服务器置于独立网络隔离区以降低暴露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/13600","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22250","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1566.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1566","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1566.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1566.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-499h-7q88-4fxx/GHSA-499h-7q88-4fxx.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/iParty.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1566.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x7000/6844/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000630.txt","https://github.com/c2siorg/bug-connector/blob/68c960cc01a4f61c238e8a780d2247db700d4a9b/Datasets/Mapped_CVE_file.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1189.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0357","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0357.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0739","title":"Microsoft Internet Information Server codebrws.asp 示例文件任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 及 Site Server 中的 codebrws.asp 示例文件存在安全漏洞，该文件原本用于展示代码浏览功能，但由于缺乏适当的访问控制和路径过滤，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意请求利用该文件读取服务器上的任意文件，包括系统敏感配置文件、用户凭据等。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可发起攻击，只需知道或猜测目标文件路径即可获取服务器上的敏感数据。该漏洞影响早期版本的 IIS 和 Site Server，建议删除或限制访问该示例文件，并及时升级到安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0739"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:57Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 IIS/Site Server 中的 codebrws.asp 示例文件，安装微软安全公告 MS99-013 提供的补丁程序。由于 IIS 4.0 和 Site Server 3.0 已停止支持，强烈建议升级至现代版本 IIS 10（Windows Server 2016/2019/2022）。临时缓解措施：通过 IIS 管理器移除所有示例应用程序目录，配置 NTFS 权限限制 web 目录的匿名访问，并使用 Web 服务器防火墙规则阻止对 /codebrws.asp 路径的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-013","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54846af4ec1affce3d519a6791531e8f1f5b8fe/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0739.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0739","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0739.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cf6074d8ac2128dee0a2ac26c5f652ae6527df79/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0739.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/iis_codebrws.nasl","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0739.yaml","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/4edc9938788d3f7fc2435789a001f306b27788b7/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/E99D88C1-C798-40D7-BB8C-47E6405B9469.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0739.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0357.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0357.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0357.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0356","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0356.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0738","title":"Microsoft IIS 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Information Services（IIS）及 Site Server 中的 code.asp 示例文件存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可利用该示例文件，通过构造特殊 HTTP 请求读取目标服务器上的任意文件内容，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响包含该示例文件的 IIS 及 Site Server 版本，攻击者无需登录凭据即可在未授权情况下访问服务器文件系统中的机密数据。该漏洞属于信息泄露类安全风险，攻击者可能借此获取配置文件、数据库凭证或其他敏感信息，为后续进一步攻击提供条件。Microsoft 建议管理员删除或限制该示例文件的访问权限以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0738"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:57Z","remediation":"立即从 IIS 和 Site Server 的 Web 根目录（如 \\inetpub\\wwwroot 及 \\Program Files\\Microsoft Site Server）中删除 code.asp 等示例脚本文件；安装微软对应安全补丁（Windows NT 4.0 SP4 / IIS 4.0 累积更新），并将 Site Server 升级至已修正该问题的版本；在无法立即升级时，使用 IIS 的“执行权限”设为“无”来禁用脚本目录执行，并通过 URLScan 拒绝包含 ../ 的路径遍历请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-013","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0f25967d744704fe14324ac10f2b57e945aed081/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0738.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0738","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0738.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cf6074d8ac2128dee0a2ac26c5f652ae6527df79/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0738.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b1565557a8e0fb04634f0989d7e7dd7febd4847/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-92vg-86x4-j5qj/GHSA-92vg-86x4-j5qj.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/4edc9938788d3f7fc2435789a001f306b27788b7/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0738.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88076/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0356.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0355","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0737","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 及 Site Server 附带的 viewcode.asp 示例脚本存在路径遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该脚本发送包含目标文件路径的特制 HTTP 请求，读取服务器文件系统中的任意文件内容，包括配置文件、源代码及敏感数据。该漏洞影响安装了上述示例脚本且未删除或未打补丁的 IIS 4.0 与 Site Server 版本，攻击者仅需目标服务器开放 Web 服务即可利用，无需任何凭据。Microsoft 已在 MS99-013 安全公告中发布补丁，建议删除 viewcode.asp 等示例脚本或升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0737"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:57Z","remediation":"立即删除 IIS 4.0 安装目录下 /scripts/showcode.asp、viewcode.asp 等示例脚本文件（默认位于 C:\\WINNT\\System32\\inetsrv\\scripts\\），并升级到 IIS 4.0 Service Pack 3 或更高版本；无法立即升级时，应在 IIS 管理器中移除示例站点并配置 NTFS 权限禁止匿名用户读取敏感目录作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-013","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0f25967d744704fe14324ac10f2b57e945aed081/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0737.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0737","https://github.com/GuangrenYu/WangYi/blob/db7e4b8b6d2f1d5bfd5908a02b4b5fcac6b3880d/poc_kb/custom/1999/CVE-1999-0737.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82035e540ee415f78310ba979a19dffd78d3cfa2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0737.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b1565557a8e0fb04634f0989d7e7dd7febd4847/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mrf7-29w2-32h3/GHSA-mrf7-29w2-32h3.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0737.yaml","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/iis_viewcode.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/ivanitlearning/CTF-Repos/blob/b5364388a861fc7457409d494a9d075d73e7867e/Vulnhub/SkyTower/Web-scan.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0737.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0355.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0352","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0736","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10794,\"outputTokens\":22,\"totalTokens\":10816}}","description":"IIS 和 Site Server 中的 showcode.asp 示例文件存在任意文件读取漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制请求访问该文件，进而读取目标服务器上的任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 4.0 和 Site Server 3.0 版本，攻击者无需任何凭证即可利用此漏洞窃取敏感信息。showcode.asp 作为 IIS 和 Site Server 自带的演示脚本，未对文件路径进行充分限制，允许攻击者通过参数指定服务器上的任意文件路径进行读取，导致信息泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0736"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:57Z","remediation":"建议安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-013 发布的补丁以修复该漏洞。受影响版本为 IIS 4.0 和 Site Server 3.0，应下载并安装对应的安全更新。如无法立即安装补丁，可删除或禁用服务器上的 showcode.asp、viewcode.asp、code.asp、codebrws.asp 等示例文件查看工具，因为这些文件仅用于演示目的，不应在生产服务器上运行。同时通过 NTFS 权限配置限制对这些文件的访问，或在 IIS 中移除相关虚拟目录映射，以阻止远程用户通过 Web 请求读取服务器上的敏感文件。此外，在防火墙层面限制对 Web 服务器端口的外部访问，并确保 Web 根目录之外的敏感文件系统文件不具有 Web 用户读取权限，作为额外缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-013","https://oval.cisecurity.org/reposi