t Excel 97 版本，攻击者需诱使用户打开恶意文件，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0717"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:54Z","remediation":"升级到 Microsoft Office 2000 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，建议禁用 Excel 中的宏自动执行功能，并在打开来自互联网的 Excel 文件前启用病毒警告机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ231304","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-014","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64d76d92cfbd9c4de4a352a59a2e52cadebc3afd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0717.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/89b3a1c34ab26afed5cfe4fc54b61cecbf09d3c2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0717.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0717","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0717.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0717.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f2000baeea1a59c64d87de15aa744d3fa2dc46eb/1999/CVE-1999-0717.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ec2efce98d544aa857266906f720ae32e42b21be/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-07xx/CVE-1999-0717.json","https://github.com/cve-search/cve-search/blob/2e25b80902ae3dfe12c2671b249d69e7944d9748/web/restapi/cve.py","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0717.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0717.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0316.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0245","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0686","title":"Netscape Enterprise Server HP-UX 长URL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Netscape Enterprise Server (NES) 在处理超长 URL 时存在拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可向运行在 HP-UX 平台上的 HP Virtual Vault (VVOS) 系统中的 NES 服务器发送特制超长 URL 请求，导致服务器进程崩溃或资源耗尽，无法正常响应合法用户请求。该漏洞影响 HP Virtual Vault 操作系统上部署的 Netscape Enterprise Server 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。厂商已发布安全补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0686"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:50Z","remediation":"Netscape Enterprise Server 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。如无法迁移，可在反向代理或防火墙层面限制传入 URL 长度不超过 4096 字节，并配置访问控制列表仅允许可信 IP 访问管理端口，以降低拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-046.shtml","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9906-098","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/985d46f062894917f05cdf3d64399a32839d12b7/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0686.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0686","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0686.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d448b12fda744aa8491fddc8705260f2b4289f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0686.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cd61cf4d5a67ce31725304e4ddf8e4e21c23dbc3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mrj2-v329-4cm9/GHSA-mrj2-v329-4cm9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0686.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/mega-foss/blob/4829eeb7b0101570abbc87d2a697f2c0c2f4e5c3/src/cve/graphql/trial.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0245.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1808","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1241","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer ActiveX FileSystemObject 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 在安全级别设置为\"中\"以下时，由于对 FileSystemObject ActiveX 对象的访问控制不足，导致远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页来调用该对象，从而在用户浏览器上下文中执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响旧版 Internet Explorer 浏览器，攻击者只需诱导用户访问恶意页面即可触发，无需额外认证。CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。修复方案为提升浏览器安全级别或安装相应安全更新。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1241"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:01Z","remediation":"将 Internet Explorer 安全级别设置为「中」或更高（工具 → Internet 选项 → 安全 → 默认级别），或通过组策略禁用 FileSystemObject ActiveX 控件：在「管理模板 → Windows 组件 → Internet Explorer → 安全功能」中启用「一致性安全区域设置」。建议升级使用 Microsoft Edge 浏览器替代已停止支持的 IE。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://oliver.efri.hr/~crv/security/bugs/NT/activex4.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2173","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1241.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1241.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1241","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1241.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1241.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qxqf-rx8x-jgrw/GHSA-qxqf-rx8x-jgrw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1241.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87843/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000628.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1808.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1083","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1367","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 浏览器缓存凭据未重置漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.0 在访问未使用标准缓存控制机制的网站时，无法正确清理已存储的用户名/密码缓存信息，导致同一系统上的其他用户能够通过共享缓存区域访问先前用户登录过的受限网站。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上使用 IE 5.0 的用户，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用该信息泄露漏洞可获取受保护站点中的敏感数据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1367"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:17Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Internet Explorer 至 6.0 或更高版本（IE 5.0 中该漏洞未修复）。在 IE「Internet 选项」→「内容」→「自动完成」中取消勾选「表单上的用户名和密码」，并勾选「不将加密的页面存盘」。通过组策略 (gpedit.msc) 启用「禁用密码缓存」(DisablePasswordCaching) 策略，防止密码被持久化存储。使用共享计算机的用户应在退出 IE 后手动清除历史记录和表单数据。该漏洞本质是缓存管理缺陷，升级浏览器是根治方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.pcworld.com/news/article/0%2Caid%2C10842%2C00.asp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1367.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1367","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1367.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1367.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w6vf-5ccm-v948/GHSA-w6vf-5ccm-v948.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1367.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000629.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8108bbe4fb0e20671face287a302a062844c09bb/1999.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0925","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0925.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1079","title":"IBM AIX 4.3 ptrace 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3 操作系统的 ptrace 系统调用存在权限检查缺陷，本地用户可通过 ptrace 附加到一个 setgid 程序，从而继承该程序的组权限，实现本地权限提升。攻击者需要拥有本地账号且能够执行 ptrace 调用，成功利用后可获得目标程序的组特权，导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1079"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-05-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-11-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"IBM 已发布 APAR IX84286 修复此漏洞，建议升级 AIX 4.3 至包含该补丁的最新维护级别。由于 AIX 4.3 已停止技术支持，建议迁移至受支持的 AIX 版本（如 AIX 7.x）以确保持续获得安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92601792420088&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93587956513233&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/servlet/support/manager?rs=0&rt=0&org=apars&doc=08E0B1A1B85472A1852567C90031BB36","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/439"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0925.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1005","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1195","title":"NAI VirusScan NT 病毒定义更新验证缺失漏洞","description":"NAI VirusScan NT 4.0.2 在通过 FTP 更新病毒定义文件 scan.dat 时存在更新验证缺陷。当更新过程实际失败时，软件仍错误地报告更新成功，导致系统管理员误认为病毒库已正确更新至最新版本。攻击者可利用此漏洞通过中间人攻击或篡改 FTP 服务器响应，使目标系统无法获取最新的病毒定义，从而降低对恶意软件的检测能力，增加系统被感染的风险。该漏洞影响 NAI VirusScan NT 4.0.2，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1195"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:55Z","remediation":"升级至 Network Associates VirusScan NT 4.0.3a，该版本已修复此问题。升级前建议先卸载或禁用 4.0.2 版本以避免服务无法正常停止。临时缓解措施：手动停止 VirusScan 引擎进程，等待数秒后手动复制病毒定义文件至 VirusScan NT 目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92588169005196&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92587579032534&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/169","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1195.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1195","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1195.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1195.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pm4g-gv9m-qf7v/GHSA-pm4g-gv9m-qf7v.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/169/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1195.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/dd9f81e9fd85457bf78c55783cb6a31e9af71d63/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0938","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0938.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1097","title":"Microsoft NetMeeting 剪贴板信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft NetMeeting 2.1 存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在聊天窗口为空时发送 CTRL-C 组合键，读取另一客户端剪贴板中的敏感内容。该漏洞源于 NetMeeting 对剪贴板访问权限控制不足，导致攻击者可跨会话获取用户复制到剪贴板的密码、文件路径等私密信息，影响使用 NetMeeting 2.1 版本的 Windows 系统，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1097"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:42Z","remediation":"升级到 Microsoft NetMeeting 2.2 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 2.2 版中得到修复。如无法升级，在召开会议时避免使用聊天窗口，或在空白聊天框中按下 Ctrl-C 前先清空本地剪贴板。鉴于 NetMeeting 已被 Microsoft 正式停止支持并从 Windows 中移除，建议迁移至 Microsoft Teams 或 Skype for Business 等受支持的现代协作工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92586457816446&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2187","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1097.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1097","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1097.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1097.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mqf5-wgx4-qfwq/GHSA-mqf5-wgx4-qfwq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88089/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1097.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c0541269-d818-4679-85ab-e9c9f0b37426.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0938.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0861","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0861.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1012","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":10240,\"inputTokens\":543,\"outputTokens\":19,\"totalTokens\":10802}}","description":"tags.<value>Lotus Domino 4.6.1 的 SMTP 邮件服务组件在处理 SMTP 命令时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送超长字符串数据触发缓冲区处理异常，导致邮件服务进程崩溃或系统重启，造成邮件服务中断。该漏洞影响运行在 AS/400 及其他操作系统上的 Domino 4.6.1 版本，CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级为中等。攻击者可通过 Telnet 或脚本工具直接构造恶意 SMTP 请求进行利用，造成拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1012"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:31Z","remediation":"建议升级到 IBM Domino 4.6.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SMTP 组件对超长字符串输入缺乏边界检查导致的拒绝服务漏洞。如暂无法升级，应在 AS/400 防火墙或网关层对 SMTP 服务（TCP 25 端口）配置访问控制列表，仅允许可信来源 IP 访问，并在 Domino 配置文档中启用 SMTP 命令长度限制，通过设置 `SMTPMaxCommandLength` 参数来拦截超长 SMTP 命令，防止攻击者利用长字符串导致邮件服务崩溃。同时监控 Domino SMTP 任务日志，发现异常长连接请求时立即阻断。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/13527","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/173","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9a9b6476a3f4a52ffa21ec6ed80d737eb0fc242b/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1012.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1012","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1012.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a6f1dc1488b4a75cccf07339e6a0f0ab45fc38ad/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1012.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/424512debdca84cc53ffa1fb3810a74f7b1905a5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r57w-9jx6-rq8c/GHSA-r57w-9jx6-rq8c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/173/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1012.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000624.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ec3d87f4-fde6-4813-a971-0de566252091.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/54a49c35dfc49a19cf6de178ce37c0c006f4fb21/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0861.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-2000","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-2000.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1553","title":"Xcmail 0.99.6 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"XCmail 0.99.6 版本在启用 autoquote 功能时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可向目标系统发送包含超长主题（subject）字段的特制邮件，触发缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，对受影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性构成完全威胁。","s